OPC UA Client

This project uses open62541, an open-source OPC UA implementation licensed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. The app links to open62541 as an external
library and this repository does not vendor or modify open62541 source code.

open62541:
  Homepage: https://open62541.org/
  Source: https://github.com/open62541/open62541
  License: MPL-2.0

The open62541 library is not vendored in this repository. Contributors install
it locally through Homebrew for development builds.

This project also depends on Swift Package Manager packages resolved in
OpcUaClient.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved.
